# expect.stdout: cleanupOnError\n
# expect.exit: 1
# expect.xfail: feature_coverage.py runs through bootstrap_general.sscript which does not yet honor `deferRunOn` path filtering. Direct semsc.py compilation is correct: the returnError path runs only the deferOnErrorOnly cleanup, not the deferOnOkOnly cleanup. `python compiler/semsc.py THIS_FILE --emit-exe /tmp/x.exe && /tmp/x.exe` prints `cleanupOnError` and exits 1. Closing means teaching bootstrap_general to collect deferRunOn lines and filter cleanup at each exit path.
project DeferRunOnFilter
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1
entry console main
error MainError
errorCase MainError DeliberateFailureForTest CSignedInt32
operation printCleanupOnOk
input operation printCleanupOnOk console Console
output operation printCleanupOnOk I32
storage module immutable okCleanupMessage CNullTerminatedByteString "cleanupOnOk"
call writeOkCleanupCall console.writeLine
argument writeOkCleanupCall console Console console
argument writeOkCleanupCall text CNullTerminatedByteString okCleanupMessage
run writeOkCleanupCall
ignore void source writeOkCleanupCall
storage module immutable okCleanupExit I32 0
return value okCleanupExit
operation printCleanupOnError
input operation printCleanupOnError console Console
output operation printCleanupOnError I32
storage module immutable errorCleanupMessage CNullTerminatedByteString "cleanupOnError"
call writeErrorCleanupCall console.writeLine
argument writeErrorCleanupCall console Console console
argument writeErrorCleanupCall text CNullTerminatedByteString errorCleanupMessage
run writeErrorCleanupCall
ignore void source writeErrorCleanupCall
storage module immutable errorCleanupExit I32 0
return value errorCleanupExit
operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
async main no
purpose operation main "deferRunOn returnOk and returnError filter which exit path runs which defer."
invariant operation main "On returnError path: only deferOnErrorOnly fires; deferOnOkOnly is skipped. Output is exactly 'cleanupOnError' (one line)."
label startMain
defer deferOnOkOnly printCleanupOnOk console
deferRunOn deferOnOkOnly returnOk
defer deferOnErrorOnly printCleanupOnError console
deferRunOn deferOnErrorOnly returnError
makeError deliberateFailure MainError.DeliberateFailureForTest
return error deliberateFailure
